Description: SOS OS core system: branding, desktop theme and system apps
 Provides the SOS OS identity on top of Debian: os-release branding, the
 SOS Dark Plasma colour scheme and look-and-feel, panel layout and Quick
 Stats widget, SDDM login theme, Plymouth splash, GRUB theme, firewall
 defaults, and the SOS Control Center, System Monitor, Updater, Welcome and
 DevHub applications with their polkit-protected helper.
